WEBVTT

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:40.000
So the model has a ranked list of candidates for the next token…

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Temperature divides every score before they become probabilities. Divide by a small number and the gaps get huge.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Divide by a big number and everything starts to look the same…
